Content in the "LoS2-DLL update" folder
- LoS2-DLL.esp and the two Light Placer json files are the author's own mod, LoS II Dynamic Lantern Lighting, updated. It is an addon of Lanterns of Skyrim II,
  and is published with the permission of that mod's author. The ESP only adds one global variable (LoS2C_LightsOn) and the json files only change conditions.
  No assets of Lanterns of Skyrim II are included in this archive.

